ity Detail":"Activity Detail","Activity Log Sent":"Activity Log Sent","Activity Report":"Activity Report","Admin Panel":"Admin Panel","AM":"AM","Add":"Add","Add action to allowlist":"Add action to allowlist","Add Allowlisted URL/Param":"Add Allowlisted URL/Param","Add code to .htaccess":"Add code to .htaccess","Add Filter":"Add Filter","Add Param to Firewall Allowlist":"Add Param to Firewall Allowlist","Additional Options":"Additional Options","Additional scan signatures (one per line)":"Additional scan signatures (one per line)","Advanced Country Blocking Options":"Advanced Country Blocking Options","Advanced Firewall Options":"Advanced Firewall Options","Advanced Scan Options":"Advanced Scan Options","Alert me when a non-admin user signs in":"Alert me when a non-admin user signs in","Alert me when someone with administrator access signs in":"Alert me when someone with administrator access signs in","Alert me when there's a large increase in attacks detected on my site":"Alert me when there's a large increase in attacks detected on my site","Alert me with scan results of this severity level or greater:":"Alert me with scan results of this severity level or greater:","Alert when an IP address is blocked":"Alert when an IP address is blocked","Alert when someone is blocked from logging in for using a password found in a breach":"Alert when someone is blocked from logging in for using a password found in a breach","Alert when someone is locked out from login":"Alert when someone is locked out from login","Alert when the \"lost password\" form is used for a valid user":"Alert when the \"lost password\" form is used for a valid user","All":"All","All Events":"All Events","All associated Wordfence Central connection data has been cleared.":"All associated Wordfence Central connection data has been cleared.","All associated Wordfence Central connection data has been removed from the local database.":"All associated Wordfence Central connection data has been removed from t