locking other countries, especially if you have not seen significant attacks from them.":"For most sites, we recommend allowing access from the United States, where Google and other benign crawlers are generally located. Many well-known crawlers also have locations in Europe, so be careful when blocking other countries, especially if you have not seen significant attacks from them.","For site owners who think they may have been hacked. More thorough but may produce false positives.":"For site owners who think they may have been hacked. More thorough but may produce false positives.","Force admins and publishers to use strong passwords (recommended)":"Force admins and publishers to use strong passwords (recommended)","Force all members to use strong passwords":"Force all members to use strong passwords","Found":"Found","Free License Installed":"Free License Installed","Friday":"Friday","Front-end Website":"Front-end Website","From":"From","Full Name":"Full Name","Full Path Disclosure":"Full Path Disclosure","General":"General","General Options":"General Options","General Wordfence Options":"General Wordfence Options","Get a new license":"Get a new license","Get Help":"Get Help","Get Your Wordfence License":"Get Your Wordfence License","Global Wordfence Options":"Global Wordfence Options","Go To Dashboard":"Go To Dashboard","Go To Option":"Go To Option","Go to Login Security":"Go to Login Security","Google Bot":"Google Bot","Google Crawlers":"Google Crawlers","Got it":"Got it","Greetings! The default configuration for Wordfence Live Traffic has changed. The new default saves only logins and blocked requests, while this site is currently recording all traffic. Would you like to change to the new default?":"Greetings! The default configuration for Wordfence Live Traffic has changed. The new default saves only logins and blocked requests, while this site is currently recording all traffic. Would you like to change to the new default?","Group By":"Group By","Header":"Header","Here's where you'll see all the blocking rules you've created. You can also manage them as well as remove or modify them from this table.":"Here's where you'll see all the blocking rules you've created. You can also manage them as well as remove or modify them from this table.","Hide File":"Hide File","Hide log":"Hide log","Hide WordPress version":"Hide WordPress version","High":"High","High Sensitivity":"High Sensitivity","Hit enter to add":"Hit enter to add","Hit enter to add a username":"Hit enter to add a username","host setting":"host setting","Hostname":"Hostname","hour":"hour","hours":"hours","How do I get to 100%?":"How do I get to 100%?","How does Wordfence determine this?":"How does Wordfence determine this?","How does Wordfence get IPs":"How does Wordfence get IPs","How long is an IP address blocked when it breaks a rule":"How long is an IP address blocked when it breaks a rule","How much memory should Wordfence request when scanning":"How much memory should Wordfence request when scanning","How should we treat Google's crawlers":"How should we treat Google's crawlers","How to block a network":"How to block a network","HTML tags will be stripped prior to output and line breaks will be converted into the appropriate tags.":"HTML tags will be stripped prior to output and line breaks will be converted into the appropriate tags.","HTTP Response Code":"HTTP Response Code","Human":"Human","Humans":"Humans","Human/Bot":"Human/Bot","If anyone's requests exceed":"If anyone's requests exceed","If a crawler's page views exceed":"If a crawler's page views exceed","If a crawler's pages not found (404s) exceed":"If a crawler's pages not found (404s) exceed","If a human's page views exceed":"If a human's page views exceed","If a human's pages not found (404s) exceed":"If a human's pages not found (404s) exceed","If autorenew is enabled for the current license, the license will renew at the next expiration date. If you would like to turn renewal off or assign the license to another site, log into wordfence.com to change it.":"If autorenew is enabled for the current license, the license will renew at the next expiration date. If you would like to turn renewal off or assign the license to another site, log into wordfence.com to change it.","If this is a false positive, you can exclude this parameter from being filtered by the firewall":"If this is a false positive, you can exclude this parameter from being filtered by the firewall","If this is your first attempt, please try again.":"If this is your first attempt, please try again.","If this option is disabled, Wordfence can look up countries for visitor IP addresses using a local database, but cannot look up regions or cities":"If this option is disabled, Wordfence can look up countries for visitor IP addresses using a local database, but cannot look up regions or cities","If user hits the relative URL":"If user hits the relative URL","If user who is allowed to access the site views the relative URL":"If user who is allowed to access the site views the relative URL","If you are using a web server not listed in the dropdown or if file permissions prevent the installer from completing successfully, you will need to perform the change manually. Click Continue below to create the required file and view manual installation instructions.":"If you are using a web server not listed in the dropdown or if file permissions prevent the installer from completing successfully, you will need to perform the change manually. Click Continue below to create the required file and view manual installation instructions.","If you cannot complete the setup process, \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eclick here for help\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E":"If you cannot complete the setup process, \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eclick here for help\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E","If you cannot complete the uninstall process, \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eclick here for help\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E":"If you cannot complete the uninstall process, \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eclick here for help\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E","If you delete the wrong file, it could cause your WordPress website to stop functioning, and you will probably have to restore from a backup.":"If you delete the wrong file, it could cause your WordPress website to stop functioning, and you will probably have to restore from a backup.","If you don't have one, you can purchase one now.":"If you don't have one, you can purchase one now.","If you don't recognize this file, please \u003Ca href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/wordfence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Econtact us on the WordPress support forums\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E before proceeding.":"If you don't recognize this file, please \u003Ca href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/wordfence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Econtact us on the WordPress support forums\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E before proceeding.","If you have automatic updates enabled (see above), you'll get an email when an update occurs.":"If you have automatic updates enabled (see above), you'll get an email when an update occurs.","If you have separate WordPress installations with Wordfence installed within a subdirectory of this site, it is recommended that you perform the Firewall installation procedure on those sites before this one.":"If you have separate WordPress installations with Wordfence installed within a subdirectory of this site, it is recommended that you perform the Firewall installation procedure on those sites before this one.","If you know your web server's configuration, please select it from the list below.":"If you know your web server's configuration, please select it from the list below.","If you need to continue using the legacy 2FA mode, you will need to downgrade to the 8.1.4 version of Wordfence temporarily. This feature will be discontinued around July 1, 2026, and legacy 2FA codes will no longer be required at that time, even when using an old plugin version.":"If you need to continue using the legacy 2FA mode, you will need to downgrade to the 8.1.4 version of Wordfence temporarily. This feature will be discontinued around July 1, 2026, and legacy 2FA codes will no longer be required at that time, even when using an old plugin version.","If you're moving to a new host or a new installation location, you may need to temporarily disable extended protection to avoid any file not found errors. Use this action to remove the configuration changes that enable extended protection mode or you can \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eremove them manually\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.":"If you're moving to a new host or a new installation location, you may need to temporarily disable extended protection to avoid any file not found errors. Use this action to remove the configuration changes that enable extended protection mode or you can \u003Ca href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Eremove them manually\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.","If you use country blocking to block countries from accessing the entire site, it is important to review the allowed services setting to ensure that search engines and other desired services may continue to see the site regardless of a crawler's location. Additionally, ad services like Google Ads may penalize listings when a country is blocked from the entire site.":"If you use country blocking to block countries from accessing the entire site, it is important to review the allowed services setting to ensure that search engines and other desired services may continue to see the site regardless of a crawler's location. Additionally, ad services like Google Ads may penalize listings when a country is blocked from the entire site.","If you use external services that may send POST requests without these headers, do not use this option, as they will be blocked.":"If you use external services that may send POST requests without these headers, do not use this option, as they will be blocked.","Include":"Include","Ignored IP addresses for Wordfence Web Application Firewall alerting":"Ignored IP addresses for Wordfence Web Application Firewall alerting","Ignored IPs must be separated by commas or placed on separate lines. These addresses will be ignored from any alerts about increased attacks and can be used to ignore things like standalone website security scanners.":"Ignored IPs must be separated by commas or placed on separate lines. These addresses will be ignored from any alerts about increased attacks and can be used to ignore things like standalone website security scanners.","Immediately block the IP of users who try to sign in as these usernames":"Immediately block the IP of users who try to sign in as these usernames","Immediately block IPs that access these URLs":"Immediately block IPs that access these URLs","Immediately lock out invalid usernames":"Immediately lock out invalid usernames","Install":"Install","Install an existing license":"Install an existing license","Install License":"Install License","Install your license to finish activating Wordfence.":"Install your license to finish activating Wordfence.","License Key":"License Key","Limit the number 