nalyze the request in any way.","Individual Allowlisting":"Individual Allowlisting","Insecure Password":"Insecure Password","Installation Failed":"Installation Failed","Installation Successful":"Installation Successful","Introducing the New Wordfence 2FA":"Introducing the New Wordfence 2FA","IP":"IP","IP Address":"IP Address","IP Address Range":"IP Address Range","IP Address to Block":"IP Address to Block","IP Detection":"IP Detection","IP Range":"IP Range","Issue Found":"Issue Found","It looks like you've tried to connect this site to Wordfence Central, but the installation did not finish.":"It looks like you've tried to connect this site to Wordfence Central, but the installation did not finish.","just now":"just now","Key":"Key","Last Attempt":"Last Attempt","Last Hit":"Last Hit","Last Updated":"Last Updated","Last Updated: %s":"Last Updated: %s","Learn More":"Learn More","Learn about Wordfence Care and Wordfence Response":"Learn about Wordfence Care and Wordfence Response","Learn about Wordfence Response":"Learn about Wordfence Response","Learn more about Blocking":"Learn more about Blocking","Learn more about the Firewall":"Learn more about the Firewall","Learn more about Global Options":"Learn more about Global Options","Learn more about Live Traffic":"Learn more about Live Traffic","Learn more about repairing modified files.":"Learn more about repairing modified files.","Learn More About Wordfence Care":"Learn More About Wordfence Care","Legacy support for SMS-based two-factor authentication has been phased out, as it is less secure than using a modern authenticator app.":"Legacy support for SMS-based two-factor authentication has been phased out, as it is less secure than using a modern authenticator app.","Legacy Two-Factor Authentication Users":"Legacy Two-Factor Authentication Users","Learning Mode":"Learning Mode","Learning Mode Enabled":"Learning Mode Enabled","Learning Mode Until":"Learning Mode Until","left":"left","less than 1 second":"less than 1 second","Let Wordfence choose when to scan my site (recommended)":"Let Wordfence choose when to scan my site (recommended)","Let Wordfence use the most secure method to get visitor IP addresses. Prevents spoofing and works with most sites.":"Let Wordfence use the most secure method to get visitor IP addresses. Prevents spoofing and works with most sites.","List of directories to exclude from recently modified file list":"List of directories to exclude from recently modified file list","License already in use":"License already in use","License is expired":"License is expired","License renews in %d days":"License renews in %d days","License renews today":"License renews today","License renews tomorrow":"License renews tomorrow","License Status":"License Status","List of comma separated IP addresses to ignore":"List of comma separated IP addresses to ignore","List of comma separated usernames to ignore":"List of comma separated usernames to ignore","Live Traffic":"Live Traffic","Live traffic defaults to a summary view of all security-related traffic. Details are viewable by clicking anywhere within the summary record. To switch to the expanded view, click the Expand All Records switch.":"Live traffic defaults to a summary view of all security-related traffic. Details are viewable by clicking anywhere within the summary record. To switch to the expanded view, click the Expand All Records switch.","Live Traffic Options":"Live Traffic Options","Live Updates Paused":"Live Updates Paused","Loading...":"Loading...","Location":"Location","Lock out after how many forgot password attempts":"Lock out after how many forgot password attempts","Lock out after how many login failures":"Lock out after how many login failures","Locked Out":"Locked Out","Locked out from logging in":"Locked out from logging in","Logged In":"Logged In","Login and firewall activity will appear below.":"Login and firewall activity will appear below.","Login Attempts":"Login Attempts","Login Form":"Login Form","Login Name":"Login Name","Logins":"Logins","Logins and Logouts":"Logins and Logouts","Look up IP or Domain":"Look up IP or Domain","Look up visitor IP locations via Wordfence servers":"Look up visitor IP locations via Wordfence servers","Low":"Low","Make Permanent":"Make Permanent","Malware Scan":"Malware Scan","Malware Signatures":"Malware Signatures","Malware Signatures Status":"Malware Signatures Status","Manage":"Manage","Manage 2FA":"Manage 2FA","Manage Blocking Rules":"Manage Blocking Rules","Manage Brute Force Protection":"Manage Brute Force Protection","Manage Firewall":"Manage Firewall","Manage Firewall Rules":"Manage Firewall Rules","Manage global blocking options.":"Manage global blocking options.","Manage Options":"Manage Options","Manage Plugins":"Manage Plugins","Manage Scan":"Manage Scan","Manage Scan Settings":"Manage Scan Settings","Manage WAF":"Manage WAF","Management of legacy two-factor authentication using SMS-based codes is deprecated, and the old method of appending \"wf\" and a code will not be supported in the future. An improved interface and usage by non-administrators is available by activating the login security module. Users who have legacy 2FA enabled will still be required to enter a code while logging in currently, but legacy 2FA users can no longer be added or removed.":"Management of legacy two-factor authentication using SMS-based codes is deprecated, and the old method of appending \"wf\" and a code will not be supported in the future. An improved interface and usage by non-administrators is available by activating the login security module. Users who have legacy 2FA enabled will still be required to enter a code while logging in currently, but legacy 2FA users can no longer be added or removed.","Manual block by administrator":"Manual block by administrator","Manual Installation Instructions":"Manual Installation Instructions","Manually Refresh Rules":"Manually Refresh Rules","Manually schedule scans":"Manually schedule scans","Mark as Fixed":"Mark as Fixed","match":"match","Maximum days to keep Live Traffic data (1-30 days)":"Maximum days to keep Live Traffic data (1-30 days)","Maximum email alerts to send per hour":"Maximum email alerts to send per hour","Maximum execution time for each scan stage":"Maximum execution time for each scan stage","Maximum number of attempts to resume each scan stage":"Maximum number of attempts to resume each scan stage","Medium":"Medium","Memory size in megabytes":"Memory size in megabytes","Mode":"Mode","Monday":"Monday","Monitor background requests from an administrator's web browser for false positives":"Monitor background requests from an administrator's web browser for false positives","More Information":"More Information","Monitor disk space":"Monitor disk space","Monitor Web Application Firewall status":"Monitor Web Application Firewall status","minute":"minute","minutes":"minutes","month":"month","months":"months","Multisite Blog Domain":"Multisite Blog Domain","Multisite Blog ID":"Multisite Blog ID","Multisite Blog Path":"Multisite Blog Path","Need help with a security issue?":"Need help with a security issue?","Never":"Never","New Login Page Captcha Feature":"New Login Page Captcha Feature","New Plugin Version":"New Plugin Version","New Theme Version":"New Theme Version","New WordPress Version":"New WordPress Version","Next":"Next","Next Update Check":"Next Update Check","Next Update Check: %s":"Next Update Check: %s","Nice work! The firewall is now optimized.":"Nice work! The firewall is now optimized.","No":"No","No activity to report yet. Please complete your first scan.":"No activity to report yet. Please complete your first scan.","No blocks are currently active.":"No blocks are currently active.","No blocks have been recorded.":"No blocks have been recorded.","No blocks match the current filter.":"No blocks match the current filter.","No Data Available During Learning Mode":"No Data Available During Learning Mode","No failed logins have been recorded.":"No failed logins have been recorded.","No issues have been ignored.":"No issues have been ignored.","No new issues have been found.":"No new issues have been found.","No notifications received":"No notifications received","No allowlisted URLs currently set.":"No allowlisted URLs currently set.","No requests to report yet.":"No requests to report yet.","No rules currently set.":"No rules currently set.","No rules were updated. Please verify you have permissions to write to the /wp-content/wflogs directory.":"No rules were updated. Please verify you have permissions to write to the /wp-content/wflogs directory.","No rules were updated. Please verify your website can reach the Wordfence servers.":"No rules were updated. Please verify your website can reach the Wordfence servers.","No rules were updated. Your website has reached the maximum number of rule update requests. Please try again later.":"No rules were updated. Your website has reached the maximum number of rule update requests. Please try again later.","No successful logins have been recorded.":"No successful logins have been recorded.","No Thanks":"No Thanks","No users currently have legacy cellphone sign-in enabled.":"No users currently have legacy cellphone sign-in enabled.","None":"None","Normal request":"Normal request","Not Active":"Not Active","Not a core, theme, or plugin file from wordpress.org":"Not a core, theme, or plugin file from wordpress.org","Not connected":"Not connected","Not recording":"Not recording","Not recording (Central disconnected)":"Not recording (Central disconnected)","NOTE":"NOTE","NOTE: This checkbox enables ALL blocking/throttling functions including IP, country and advanced blocking, and the \"Rate Limiting Rules\" below.":"NOTE: This checkbox enables ALL blocking/throttling functions including IP, country and advanced blocking, and the \"Rate Limiting Rules\" below.","Note":"Note","Note: Status will update when changes are saved":"Note: Status will update when