ge not found","Page Visited":"Page Visited","Pages Not Found":"Pages Not Found","Paid Members Only":"Paid Members Only","Password Strength":"Password Strength","Payment Method Expired":"Payment Method Expired","Payment Method Expiring":"Payment Method Expiring","Payment Method Invalid":"Payment Method Invalid","Payment Method Missing":"Payment Method Missing","Part of the Firewall configuration procedure for NGINX depends on creating a \u003Ccode\u003E%1$s\u003C/code\u003E file in the root of your WordPress installation. This file can contain sensitive information and public access to it should be restricted. We have \u003Ca href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003Einstructions on our documentation site\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E on what directives to put in your nginx.conf to fix this.":"Part of the Firewall configuration procedure for NGINX depends on creating a \u003Ccode\u003E%1$s\u003C/code\u003E file in the root of your WordPress installation. This file can contain sensitive information and public access to it should be restricted. We have \u003Ca href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003Einstructions on our documentation site\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E (opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E on what directives to put in your nginx.conf to fix this.","Participate in the Real-Time Wordfence Security Network":"Participate in the Real-Time Wordfence Security Network","Pause live updates when window loses focus":"Pause live updates when window loses focus","Performance Options":"Performance Options","Permanent":"Permanent","Phone (%s)":"Phone (%s)","Please Complete Wordfence Installation":"Please Complete Wordfence Installation","Please enter a valid email address":"Please enter a valid email address","Please try again. If the problem persists, please \u003Ca href=\"https://www.wordfence.com/help/api-key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Econtact Wordfence Support\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E(opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E":"Please try again. If the problem persists, please \u003Ca href=\"https://www.wordfence.com/help/api-key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003Econtact Wordfence Support\u003Cspan class=\"screen-reader-text\"\u003E(opens in new tab)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E","Premium License Installed":"Premium License Installed","Prevent discovery of usernames through '/?author=N' scans, the oEmbed API, the WordPress REST API, and WordPress XML Sitemaps":"Prevent discovery of usernames through '/?author=N' scans, the oEmbed API, the WordPress REST API, and WordPress XML Sitemaps","Prevent the use of passwords leaked in data breaches":"Prevent the use of passwords leaked in data breaches","Prevent users registering 'admin' username if it doesn't exist":"Prevent users registering 'admin' username if it doesn't exist","Preview":"Preview","Pick":"Pick","Pick from List":"Pick from List","Please \u003Ca href=\"%s\"\u003Eclick here\u003C/a\u003E to configure the Firewall to run correctly on this site.":"Please \u003Ca href=\"%s\"\u003Eclick here\u003C/a\u003E to configure the Firewall to run correctly on this site.","Please download a backup of the following files before we make the necessary changes:":"Please download a backup of the following files before we make the necessary changes:","Please enter a valid IP address or domain name for your whois lookup.":"Please enter a valid IP address or domain name for your whois lookup.","Please enter a valid email address.":"Please enter a valid email address.","Please include your support ticket number or forum username.":"Please include your support ticket number or forum username.","Please make a backup of this file before proceeding. If you need to restore this backup file, you can copy it to the following path from your site's root:":"Please make a backup of this file before proceeding. If you need to restore this backup file, you can copy it to the following path from your site's root:","Please read this article in our FAQ to make an important change that will ensure your site stability during an update.":"Please read this article in our FAQ to make an important change that will ensure your site stability during an update.","Please confirm the switch to the new 2FA mode. This change will be permanent.":"Please confirm the switch to the new 2FA mode. This change will be permanent.","Please specify a reason":"Please specify a reason","Please specify a valid IP address range in the form of \"1.2.3.4 - 1.2.3.5\" without quotes. Make sure the dash between the IP addresses in a normal dash (a minus sign on your keyboard) and not another character that looks like a dash.":"Please specify a valid IP address range in the form of \"1.2.3.4 - 1.2.3.5\" without quotes. Make sure the dash between the IP addresses in a normal dash (a minus sign on your keyboard) and not another character that looks like a dash.","Please specify either an IP address range, Hostname or a web browser pattern to match.":"Please specify either an IP address range, Hostname or a web browser pattern to match.","Please use the login security module.":"Please use the login security module.","PM":"PM","Plugin Abandoned":"Plugin Abandoned","Plugin has unpatched security issues.":"Plugin has unpatched security issues.","Plugin Removed":"Plugin Removed","Plugin Upgrade":"Plugin Upgrade","Plugin Name":"Plugin Name","Plugin Vulnerable":"Plugin Vulnerable","POST Body":"POST Body","Post":"Post","Posted on":"Posted on","Posts, Comments, & Files":"Posts, Comments, & Files","Premium Feature":"Premium Feature","Premium License Conflict":"Premium License Conflict","Premium License Deactivated":"Premium License Deactivated","Premium Protection Disabled":"Premium Protection Disabled","Premium Protection Enabled":"Premium Protection Enabled","Previous":"Previous","Product Updates":"Product Updates","Promotions":"Promotions","Protect More Sites":"Protect More Sites","Protection Level":"Protection Level","Protection from known and emerging threats":"Protection from known and emerging threats","Public Files":"Public Files","Put Geographic Protection In Place With Country Blocking":"Put Geographic Protection In Place With Country Blocking","Query String":"Query String","Quarantined File":"Quarantined File","Rate Limiting":"Rate Limiting","Rate limiting based on type of request (human vs crawler) may be less accurate because this prevents loading the extra JavaScript used for that identification.":"Rate limiting based on type of request (human vs crawler) may be less accurate because this prevents loading the extra JavaScript used for that identification.","Real-Time IP Blocklist":"Real-Time IP Blocklist","Reason":"Reason","Recent":"Recent","Recent Activity":"Recent Activity","Recommended":"Recommended","Recommended Settings Change":"Recommended Settings Change","Register with Wordfence to secure your site with the latest threat intelligence.":"Register with Wordfence to secure your site with the latest threat intelligence.","Reputation Check Status":"Reputation Check Status","Reputation Checks":"Reputation Checks","Reputation check":"Reputation check","Reconnect This Site":"Reconnect This Site","Recording (significant events only)":"Recording (significant events only)","Recording (all events)":"Recording (all events)","Recovery Codes":"Recovery Codes","Redirect to the URL below":"Redirect to the URL below","Redirected":"Redirected","Redirected by Country Blocking bypass URL":"Redirected by Country Blocking bypass URL","Referer":"Referer","Referrer":"Referrer","Registered Users":"Registered Users","Regular traffic and security-related traffic will appear below.":"Regular traffic and security-related traffic will appear below.","Reload":"Reload","Renew License":"Renew License","Remove Extended Protection":"Remove Extended Protection","Remove Invalid 